I think it's to keep them at depth.  If stalkers weren't stunned, they
would track you mercilessly.  They would follow you by sight and by
sound and active immediately.  As it is they stagger around looking
for you so it's about as easy for them to miss you as for you to miss
them.  It does seem like once they start combat with you they
stick to it but that might be an incorrect impression on my part.



